# Tables this project deliberately does not have.
#
# The audit skips them entirely, so their columns stop appearing as findings.
# Everything listed here needs a reason — an unexplained entry is how a real
# break gets silenced. Delete a line to start checking that table again.

# Test results with attached files is a LabHive-only feature (confirmed
# Sept 20 2026). ResultsTab in ProjectMaterial.jsx is declared but never
# rendered here, so the code referencing these tables cannot execute.
test_result_entries
project_record_files
project_files
project_supplies
analysis_comments

# ICT-Lab is team-only: one organisation, no solo workspaces, no solo_users
# table. Every solo code path is unreachable here.
solo_users
solo_workspace_invites
solo_workspace_members
solo_workspace_transfer_requests

# Solo-only columns in code shared with LabHive. ICT-Lab is team-only, so every
# reference sits behind an `if (isSolo)` that is never true here — verified
# Sept 21 2026, including SoloAddEquipmentModal, which is itself rendered
# behind an isSolo guard. Remove these lines if ICT-Lab ever gains solo mode.
equipment_inventory.solo_owner_id
inspections.solo_owner_id

# Extractor bleed, not a column: every hit is an sb.rpc() call, a `user_id`
# filter on a DIFFERENT table, or a `meta.booking_user_id` object property.
users.user_id
